        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "salz",
          "text": "Speaking with an attorney at Dormer Harpring is risk-free. We offer contingency fee payment options meaning we base your fee on the amount we recover. Let our team help you move forward towards your best resolution and start your healing process.",
