      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "samr",
          "text": "In Colorado, there are statutes of limitations placed upon personal injury lawsuits depending on the type of accident. It is prudent to consult with an experienced personal injury attorney to discuss your personal injury claim and its statute of limitations.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bamu",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "samt",
          "text": "What Is Negligence in Colorado?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bamw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "samv",
          "text": "In personal injury law, negligence refers to the failure to act in a way that a reasonable and prudent person would have acted in the same or similar circumstances. A person can be guilty of negligence with any action or omission that falls outside of the accepted standards of care. When negligence causes injury or harm to another person, the injured victim may hold the negligent party legally and financially responsible.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bamy",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "samx",
          "text": "How Is Fault Determined in Injury Cases?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ban0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "samz",
          "text": "Determining fault in an injury case in Boulder takes identifying the party or parties who caused or significantly contributed to the accident in question. During a personal injury case, it is the injured victim’s burden to prove a defendant’s fault based on a preponderance of the evidence. This means the plaintiff or plaintiff’s attorney must demonstrate using clear and convincing evidence that the defendant more likely than not caused the injury.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ban2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "san1",
          "text": "Proving fault in an injury case takes evidence of four key elements:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ban4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "san3",
          "text": "A duty of care was owed. The defendant had a legal responsibility to act in a reasonable manner.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ban6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "san5",
          "text": "A duty of care was breached. The defendant did not act in a reasonable manner based on the circumstances.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ban8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "san7",
          "text": "The defendant’s breach of duty caused the accident. The defendant’s misconduct or wrongdoing was the proximate (main) cause of the accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bana",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "san9",
          "text": "The plaintiff suffered compensable losses. The plaintiff has real and specific financial, physical or emotional damages from the accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "banc",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sanb",
          "text": "Evidence that may be available to help you prove fault includes a police accident report, eyewitness statements, photographs and videos, medical records, and expert testimony. The right attorney in Boulder can help you collect evidence and present it in a clear and convincing manner to an insurance company, judge or jury for the best odds of proving fault.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bane",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sand",
          "text": "How to Proceed After a Personal Injury Accident",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bang",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sanf",
          "text": "A lot of fear and confusion immediately follows a personal injury. There are steps to take after an accident that will help in any future recovery.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bani",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sanh",
          "text": "The most important of these are as follows:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bank",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sanj",
          "text": "Seek medical attention and attend all follow-up appointments",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "banm",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sanl",
          "text": "Document the scene by taking pictures and gathering all witness information. If you are unable, ask someone else to do so",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bano",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sann",
          "text": "Call the police and file an accident report",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "banq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sanp",
          "text": "Contact your insurance company and notify them of the accident. Never admit fault",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bans",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sanr",
          "text": "Speak with a personal injury attorney before making any statements or signing any documents",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "banu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sant",
          "text": "If you cannot complete all of these steps before seeing an attorney, do not worry. The right personal injury lawyer in Boulder can help you with an insurance claim or injury lawsuit regardless of what steps you did or did not take after your accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "banw",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sanv",
          "text": "What Damages Can I Recover in Colorado?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bany",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sanx",
          "text": "A successful personal injury lawsuit in Colorado can provide a monetary award to make you whole again. This means enough financial compensation to put you in the financial position you would have been in had the accident not occurred. There is compensation available for many different types of damages in Colorado. A positive settlement or jury verdict could include an amount to cover your past and future:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
